{
  "description": "Golden cases for the box-format runtime model. Every implementation of the format - the Node reference in src/contract/runtimes.mjs, the Rust mirror, the Python mirror - must produce these answers exactly. A target says which machine a box runs on; a runtime says what runs inside it, and these are the rules that answer the second question.",
